name: 12.1-plain-pipe-typed
mapping: typed
spec: 12.1
expect: bash
=== dot ===
digraph {
  log[shape=note,label="access.log"] g[label="grep 404"] w[label="wc -l"]
  log -> g -> w }
=== modl ===
log hex    access.log
g   square grep 404
w   square wc -l
log -> g -> w
=== bash ===
grep 404 < access.log | wc -l
